+# Architecture v1
+
+This source specifies HTTP with JSON payloads for public client integrations. It
+allows internal gRPC experimentation but does not approve gRPC as the default
+transport.
+
+## Important assertions
+
+- Public client integrations use HTTP with JSON payloads (heading "Public transport",
+  lines 5-8). Reconciled in [transport-public-http-json](../topics/transport.md#claim-transport-public-http-json).
+- Internal services may experiment with gRPC, but it is not approved as the default
+  transport (heading "Internal experimentation", lines 10-13). Reconciled in
+  [transport-internal-grpc-experiment-not-default](../topics/transport.md#claim-transport-internal-grpc-experiment-not-default).
